# Build-context filter for apps/marketing/Dockerfile.
#
# The root .dockerignore excludes `apps` outright (it is written for the API image).
# BuildKit prefers this file when building with -f apps/marketing/Dockerfile, so it
# has to re-admit apps/marketing. Set DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1 or the build fails at COPY.
#
# This image needs exactly two paths: apps/marketing and docker/static-server.mjs.
# Everything else is excluded, which keeps the context at a few hundred kB instead of
# shipping the whole monorepo to the daemon.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.turbo
.git
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*

packages
services
apps/customer-web
apps/admin-web
apps/owner-web
apps/customer-mobile
docs
design
Logos
Presantation
.claude
.github
/*.zip
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png
/*.html
/pnpm-lock.yaml
netlify.toml

# The site's own version-control and editor droppings.
apps/marketing/.git
